  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let the function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></mtd><mtd><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>10</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>if</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;be continuous at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>.&nbsp;Then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
